# Which LOCAL files follow you into a new worktree.
#
# gitignore syntax. A file is copied only if it matches a pattern here AND is
# already gitignored AND already exists in your main checkout. Nothing here
# adds anything to git, and nothing here can cause a file to be committed --
# this is purely "copy my local config into the new working copy so the build
# works there too".
#
# Without it, a fresh worktree has no local.properties and the build fails on
# the first command you run in it.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.dev.vars
.envrc
local.properties
keystore.properties
config/secrets.json
.vibe/
